      "created_at": "2012-07-18T22:26:12.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>That’s right!  GTG will have a booth at Spiel this year in Essen, Germany.  The convention runs from the 18th through the 21st of October.  We’ll have more details in the future, but we figured we’d give a heads up to anyone planning to be in the area in October <img src=\"//forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/slight_smile.png?v=9\" title=\":slight_smile:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":slight_smile:\"></p>",
      "post_number": 1,
