    {
      "id": 35345,
      "name": "Val",
      "username": "Val",
      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/v/e56c9b/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2012-10-19T21:37:43.000Z",
      "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"Rabit\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/rabit/48/5774_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Rabit:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Hey, Val, how did you think the con was going for &gt;G? Did they look decently busy? Selling much product?&nbsp;No stress if you don't feel like you could tell - just curious how are guys are doing out there.  <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/slightly_smiling_face.png?v=12\" title=\":slightly_smiling_face:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":slightly_smiling_face:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"></p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>I'm just a player, and one of my friends directed us to the booth. I have no idea how they were doing, saleswise. However, the hall they were in usually has less traffice than some of the other halls. I hope it went well for them. I really do. As much as some US people love to get their hands on Eurostyle games… well, my little gaming group is thrilled to finally get our hands on the so called 'Ameritrash' <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/smiley.png?v=12\" title=\":smiley:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":smiley:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"> It's not exactly so easy to get here.</p>",
      "post_number": 10,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T02:09:13.460Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
      "reply_to_post_number": null,
      "quote_count": 0,
      "incoming_link_count": 0,
