      "created_at": "2012-10-24T17:48:06.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Essen went fairly well for us! We'd of course love to be in one of the busier halls (halls 10-12 are probably out of the question, but hall 9 would be fantastic). We are going to consider things over the next couple months, but it is reasonably likely that we'll be back next year (especially considering that we'll have 2 to 3 new products by then!)</p>",
